WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.800
Let’s walk through Your role in the exercise.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.125
Use this opening step to establish ownership before learning controls

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:07.300
.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.463
Identify what this seat creates or reviews, what must

00:00:10.463 --> 00:00:13.600
be handed to another role, and which decisions remain

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.312
outside your authority.

00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:18.575
On this slide, as Industry Team Facilitator, you

00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:22.400
keep Industry Team's deliberation moving and own the final review

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.413
boundary.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.585
In practice, use the deck to structure the room

00:00:26.585 --> 00:00:29.773
, inspect what the Scribe forwarded, resolve omissions with

00:00:29.773 --> 00:00:32.735
the team, and submit only when the artifact represents

00:00:32.735 --> 00:00:34.347
the agreed decision.

00:00:34.347 --> 00:00:37.135
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:37.135 --> 00:00:39.623
The Scribe authors and forwards the record.

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:41.847
You review, project, and submit it to White

00:00:41.847 --> 00:00:42.722
Cell.

00:00:42.722 --> 00:00:45.835
Presentation and submission are separate actions.
